<mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;JET FREIGHT LOGISTICS LIMITED — AIR EXPORT GENERAL CARGO &amp; BILLING SOP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:12px;font-weight:normal;&#x27;&gt;End-to-End Workflow: Dynamic Rate Matching, Fuel Surcharge Hedging, Booking Entry, Operational Handover, 3-Way Billing Reconciliation &amp; Invoicing&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#1e293b;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=center;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
